{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "section_title", "parent_tag": "036J", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\section{", "suffix": "}\n\\label{section-fpqc-local-source}"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:4d84b73b995c21b24675583a0fc03ff3811d67996506d747aeea0d1c8a6d2190", "source_text": "Properties of morphisms local in the fpqc topology on the source", "source_text_hash": "sha256:39a9a4800cb6c811dde7ed25f11318449e59bbf7b7c4bb755d88eb2cb8ec2e61", "unit_id": "tag:036J:title"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "036J", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:8a9637493f24bc928d4475dcec87499cead3b184b977224e636370634e2bff20", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nHere are some properties of morphisms that are fpqc local on the source.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:2553300978da0e20f56d812f33e007347f7d0ee1ebc61b3e0ed4acfd3ee15374", "unit_id": "tag:036J:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "036J", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{P}(f)=$", "MATH_0002": "$f$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-flat-fpqc-local-source}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:ab35b345eca890fe8040be42a5f3825cfdbd2d4cf600ac61d7c02fb30bea35e6", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c37f3b1672e5bd43405a30be616e2cbc088c6a5f0fbf1944abb813188f39009a", "source_text": "The property <MATH_0001>``<MATH_0002> is flat'' is fpqc local on the source.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b1de048d35fe9ca762c9a4d5046fe5d64e5c290659096ee5bf8bc689dedad082", "unit_id": "tag:036K:statement"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "036J", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$A \\to B \\to C$", "MATH_0002": "$B \\to C$", "MATH_0003": "$A \\to B$", "MATH_0004": "$A \\to C$", "MATH_0005": "$A \\to B$", "MATH_0006": "$A \\to C$", "MATH_0007": "$A \\to C$", "MATH_0008": "$B \\to C$", "MATH_0009": "$A \\to B$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{morphisms-definition-flat}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-composition-flat}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-local-flat-ff}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-flat-permanence}", "REF_0005": "\\ref{morphisms-lemma-flat-permanence}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:c40e354364dfdbdbdfdd9a411f04b3d36fd7742d3fb9c7b84fb14b7c38a9c8d2", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:b2275d900148848a17182841a71da6841921b8b6da248124a893b99b4267be22", "source_text": "Since flatness is defined in terms of the maps of local rings\n(Morphisms, Definition <REF_0001>)\nwhat has to be shown is the following\nalgebraic fact: Suppose <MATH_0001> are local homomorphisms of local\nrings, and assume <MATH_0002> is flat. Then <MATH_0003> is\nflat if and only if <MATH_0004> is flat.\nIf <MATH_0005> is flat, then <MATH_0006> is flat by\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0002>.\nConversely, assume <MATH_0007> is flat.\nNote that <MATH_0008> is faithfully\nflat, see\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0003>.\nHence <MATH_0009> is flat by\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0004>.\n(Also see Morphisms, Lemma <REF_0005>\nfor a direct proof.)\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:ada3511fd2383a003804e0aac1250ad843389ae2d8ea955275bd735ad8e6ba34", "unit_id": "tag:036K:proof"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "036J", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{P}(f : X \\to Y)=$", "MATH_0002": "$x \\in X$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{O}_{Y, f(x)} \\to \\mathcal{O}_{X, x}$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-injective-local-rings-fpqc-local-source}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:ad66b1ee5cb138fe35f28a8bbe939a42aefeb54d0c495cb4cd1a23fe0cc46070", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e0ed8ffa29e050ee0322f0441206a4a8b38b6acfae7e66edc7a2f9799d6c1847", "source_text": "Then property\n<MATH_0001>``for every <MATH_0002> the map of local\nrings <MATH_0003> is injective''\nis fpqc local on the source.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:fdda82002b0cbcaa3bf66677505f88c514ab5f6c003a0cd4fdc8fb42c125c0ad", "unit_id": "tag:036L:statement"}
